12. INNER JOIN vs LEFT JOIN
INNER JOIN-Returns only matching records.
LEFT JOIN- Returns all records from left and matching from right

13. Departments Having More Than 5 Employees

select dept_id,
       count(*) as tot_employees
from employees
group by dept_id
where count(*)>5;

COUNT(*): Counts every single row in the group.
COUNT(column_name): Only counts rows where that specific column has data (it skips NULL or empty values).
COUNT(DISTINCT column_name): Only counts unique, different values in that column.


14. Month-wise Sales Report
sale_id   sale_date  product  amount
 1        2026-01-05 Laptop   50000
 2        2026-01-12  Phone   15000
 3        2026-02-14  Mouse   1000 
 4        2026-02-28  Monitor  12000
